Well, I believe this is only the second time ever I've gotten a character
to the castle. The first one was a dungeon-diving valkyrie ages ago who
dug past medusa and was killed almost instantly at the castle. (completely
unprepared, as I recall. I was totally unspoiled and I figure I must
have had no MR, MC, reflection, and probably no extra intrinsics.)

 Her AC is -27, it would've been better but she accidentally evaporated
her T-shirt in an enchanting accident. I'm not used to having that many
pieces of armor and I thought I'd taken off everything! Have to stop
counting and start reading instead. I enchanted her cloak twice, then took
it off and put on the cornuthaum I'd found, and bam! No more t-shirt. Oh
well. Naked ac of 1 and all the rest is still good. She got crowned which
was a bit annoying since she's still missing a bunch of spellbooks and now
it's much slower going.
 Medusa's was a pushover for Alys, though the Minotaur below had her
worried for a moment... He hit pretty hard, but he still went down fast.
A Master Lich popped up and died very quickly as well, but there won't be
any more since she hit up her stash and geno'ed the lot of 'em.
 There was no Ludios this game, which sucks since I was hoping Gray Alys
could avenge my valkyrie Jirel, who I was feeling sure would ascend until
Croesus introduced her to his cousin YASD. I'm still amazed at how hard
that guy can hit for an @.

 I'm doing the castle now, even though she hit level 14 on the way back
down to it. The quest seems a bit more threatening to her than a whole
bunch of non-sleep-resistant soldiers marching one by one out to die. Plus
there are three silver dragons in there, and silver dragonscale mail would
let her take off the amulet of reflection and go with life saving. OTOH,
black is good, since she has no disintegration resistance yet. I wanted to
ascend her with gray dragon scale mail, but since I've already fooproofed
and +4'ed her cloak of magic resistance, I guess I'll save that for some
other time. I think style points will have to wait for YAAP, not YAFAP.

 Did I mention she's wishless 'till now? Not voluntarily, just no
opportunities. Heh. I thought she'd have had one by now since smoky
potions are fruit juice, but having cleaned the dungeon, mines, and
sokoban, she had a total of 5 potions of fruit juice. 3 of those came from
cleared poison!
 She has had one pious dungeon so far, with a whopping eight altars (three
attended) in just the main dungeon. OTOH, not a single scroll of charging
(had to write one) nor a spellbook of polymorph or dig to be found..
 Wish her luck, she's gonna need it with me calling in the orders. :)

